<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse to drop Goldsun from BUX basket.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse to drop Goldsun from BUX basket.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) said on Wednesday it would drop frozen food maker Goldsun shares from the BUX index basket from Thursday due to liquidation proceedings against it.</p>
<p>&quot;Due to the liquidation process (against Goldsun) Goldsun stocks will be taken out of the BUX index basket from January 16, 1997.</p>
<p>The BUX index will include 24 stocks from tomorrow.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
